  "rationale": "Reference probe with exit_prepare_m=300 (new), lane_cooldown_s=6, speed_gain_mps=3.5 shows reduced lane changes and no regression in min_clearance_m or hard_brakes; it triggers deceleration earlier than the baseline 130\u202fm threshold, preventing repeated reversals while keeping the same safe clearance. This early\u2011slowing adjustment addresses the observed unnecessary shifts without repeating an ineffective later trigger.",
